            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DujbdMFsZoJEjnxrnG0l0hTFgvf\">Overall, all types of investments showed an upward trend over the period, with gold experiencing the most dramatic increase, particularly after 2006. Both fine art and gold values demonstrated significant volatility, while company shares and property showed more steady growth patterns.</div>\n</div>",
